    <string name="about_free">Free software, free of charge and free of advertising, written by and for the community: no account, no tracking, nothing to buy.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choose_title">Choose a satellite</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choose_body">The button under the compass picks what to aim at: the one with the icon above. Below is the list you starred, highest first, and only what stands above your horizon. Pick the one to start with.</string>
